I see them on television.

00:09:52.982 --> 00:09:55.716
Strange, I seem them, I like
them, I make a phone call.

00:09:55.716 --> 00:09:57.731
I can meet anybody, do what I want to do.

00:09:57.731 --> 00:10:00.826
But I didn't have any peace.

00:10:00.826 --> 00:10:03.114
You know? I didn't have
peace. And now I'm at the -

00:10:03.114 --> 00:10:04.741
I'm not even at the height of my career.

00:10:04.741 --> 00:10:06.728
I don't make a tenth of
the money I made then.

00:10:06.728 --> 00:10:08.663
And I've got cartoons. I have a show.

00:10:08.663 --> 00:10:11.525
I could have never accomplished
this when I was fighting.

00:10:11.525 --> 00:10:13.189
I would never gotten
along with the producer.

00:10:13.189 --> 00:10:14.907
I would have been arrogant. I would -

00:10:14.907 --> 00:10:17.591
It's just - you learn humbleness
as you get older in life.

00:10:17.591 --> 00:10:20.081
And you learn, um - if you
don't come in this world

00:10:20.081 --> 00:10:24.124
humble, this world will
thrust humbleness upon you.

00:10:24.124 --> 00:10:26.442
- [Interviewer] Do you
think it's more important

00:10:26.442 --> 00:10:27.586
