of love have we hurt?

00:10:39.232 --> 00:10:41.428
Just think about it. Everybody
that's listening to me.

00:10:41.428 --> 00:10:43.617
Out of the obligation of
love, this is my sister,

00:10:43.617 --> 00:10:46.316
