knew this not his child.

00:10:52.289 --> 00:10:54.685
Or whatever the situation
may be. You know what I mean?

00:10:54.685 --> 00:10:56.660
We just have to know, um -

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.379
this is what it is. You know what I mean?

00:10:59.379 --> 00:11:02.503
Some people can get by
with just being respected.

00:11:02.503 --> 00:11:05.573
Some people get high off of being feared.

00:11:05.573 --> 00:11:06.991
